    "body": "No, this is not meant to be this way. It has a boolean associated to it. That boolean is named \"parser cannot change the mode flag\". You can tell this because \"parser cannot change the mode flag\" is bolded. The meaning of that boolean is that if it's true (i.e. the flag is on), the parser cannot change the mode.\n\nI hope this helps.",
